Package: patrone-unpack
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, apt, flatpak, pkexec
Description: Patrone's app for archives, .deb packages and Flatpak apps
 Patrone Unpack opens zip, tar (gzip, xz, bzip2, zstd), 7z and rar
 archives as folders, with Extract all and Extract here, and opens a
 single file from one with a double-click. It also installs Flatpak apps
 (.flatpak bundles, .flatpakref and .flatpakrepo files) for the account
 that opens them, with no password, setting up Flathub when an app's
 runtime comes from there, and .deb packages for everyone once an
 administrator's password is given. It shows what each one is first: its
 version, size, permissions or what else it needs.
